# Whitelist: only the sources and module files enter the build context.
# This doubles as a leak guard — instance files (niceat.json, Porkbun keys,
# reaper_state.json) must never reach the daemon, even if their names change.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!cmd/**
!frontend
!frontend/**
# Re-ignored after the whitelist (last match wins): stale local build
# outputs must not shadow what the image builds from source, and
# node_modules would bloat the context.  cmd/niceat/web likewise holds
# only the local pnpm build product — the image gets the artifact from
# the frontend stage, never from the developer's tree.
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
cmd/niceat/web

